&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-little-creeper&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6372745&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606569450&quot; alt=&quot;A Little Creeper&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6372745)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-little-creeper&quot;  &gt;A Little Creeper&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;脚注&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-245595-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. 真的很简短&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-245595-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. 研究员Creeper拒绝回答有关此习惯的来源的问题。&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</description>
